<%- include('header') %>
<h1>Import / Export</h1>
<p>One committed import per tab. Review every row before committing. Historical weekly totals should cover periods before app activity logging, to avoid double-counting.</p>
<p>Use separate Pipeline and Weekly Tracker CSV exports. The Legend tab is ignored. The fictional Golden Triangle Orthodontics / Dr. Sarah Lee row is skipped. Imported prospects default to Alanna.</p>
<div class="row">
<a href="/export/pipeline">Export pipeline CSV</a>
<a href="/export/weekly">Export weekly CSV</a>
</div>
<% for(const [kind,columns] of Object.entries(headers)){ %>
<details>
<summary>
<%= kind %> CSV header template</summary>
<pre>
<%= columns.map(x=>'"'+x+'"').join(',') %>
</pre>
</details>
<% } %>
<% if(preview){ %>
<section class="card">
<h2>Preview: <%= preview.kind %> — <%= preview.rows.length %> rows</h2>
<% if(preview.ignored){ %><p>Legend ignored. No records will be imported.</p><% } %>
<p>Fictional sample rows skipped: <%= preview.skipped||0 %></p>
<% if(preview.needsLanes){ %>
<form method="post" action="/import/review">
<input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>">
<p>The CSV has no service-lane column. Choose each Technical Assessment row’s lane explicitly; Likely Tier remains a signal and is not used to infer the lane.</p>
<% for(const [i,row] of preview.data.entries()){if(row.stage==='Technical Assessment'&&!row.service_lane){ %>
<label for="lane_<%= i %>"><%= row.business_name %> / <%= row.contact_name %></label>
<select id="lane_<%= i %>" name="lane_<%= i %>" required><option value="">Choose lane…</option><option value="Business IT Integration">BII — map to Discovery</option><option value="Managed IT">Managed IT — keep Technical Assessment</option></select>
<% }} %><button>Review mapped rows</button></form>
<% } %>
<% if(preview.kind==='pipeline'&&!preview.needsLanes){for(const row of preview.data){if(row.service_lane){ %><p><%= row.business_name %>: <%= row.service_lane %> → <%= row.stage %></p><% }}} %>
<div class="table-wrap">
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<% for(const h of (headers[preview.kind]||[])){ %>
<th>
<%= h %>
</th>
<% } %>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<% for(const row of preview.rows){ %>
<tr>
<% for(const v of row){ %>
<td>
<%= v %>
</td>
<% } %>
</tr>
<% } %>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<form method="post" action="/import/commit">
<input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>">
<button <%= preview.needsLanes||!preview.rows.length?'disabled':'' %>>Commit these rows</button>
</form>
</section>
<% } %>
<form method="post" action="/import/preview" class="card">
<input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>">
<label>Tab</label>
<select name="kind">
<option value="pipeline">Pipeline</option>
<option value="weekly">Weekly Tracker</option>
<option value="legend">Legend (ignored)</option>
</select>
<label>CSV file</label>
<input id="csv-file" type="file" accept=".csv,text/csv">
<label>CSV contents</label>
<textarea id="csv-content" name="csv" rows="12" required>
</textarea>
<button>Preview import</button>
</form>
<%- include('footer') %>